WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:01.690
What's up everybody!

00:00:01.690 --> 00:00:02.709
We are Pongfinity

00:00:02.709 --> 00:00:04.440
Today we are going to find out

00:00:04.440 --> 00:00:07.290
With how many balls we can play at the same
time

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:09.580
Let's start off with 2 balls.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:41.000
I think that was too easy for us.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:43.280
Let's do it with 3.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.780
That was easier than it was with 2!

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:15.160
Miikka, do you think we can do it with 4 balls?

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:16.700
For sure we can.

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:25.600
Why didn't you hit them?

00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:54.600
That went quite well.

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:03.040
Okay, so 4 was fairly easy.

00:02:03.440 --> 00:02:05.679
Now, let's try with 5 balls.

00:02:05.679 --> 00:02:07.420
Do you think it's possible?

00:02:07.420 --> 00:02:08.760
I really don't know.

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:10.080
Let's see.

00:02:44.600 --> 00:02:46.560
Magnificent!

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:48.160
Marvellous!

00:02:57.520 --> 00:02:58.640
That was pretty good!

00:03:00.200 --> 00:03:02.960
I mean, just look at that beard.

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:08.200
If you want to have as good feeling as me

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:12.600
You should rub your racket in my beard.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:19.440
Emil, should we try 6?

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:21.360
I think we should give it a go.

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:38.160
There is no way this is going to work out.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:39.200
So close!

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:57.280
Not, not bad enough.

00:03:57.480 --> 00:03:58.480
Not bad?

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:00.400
Not bad enough!

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:04.040
We have to go even worse!

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:07.000
We have to get worse!

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:09.760
We are too good!

00:04:17.440 --> 00:04:19.520
You got it?

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:20.800
We had it!

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:23.840
That was... good enough!

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:39.960
Was it ok?

00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:40.970
I think it was!

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:44.060
I think it was good for my part.

00:04:44.060 --> 00:04:46.280
For your part, yeah!

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:48.200
So this was our best shot

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:50.110
Of playing with as many balls as possible.

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:51.210
Hope you enjoyed it!

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:52.690
Remember to subscribe here

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:54.490
And watch our previous videos there.

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:55.349
Until next time!

